# Purpose: Verify duplicate product name handling

POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "bf4de052-2e23-4940-a63d-76b465e0ee2d",
  "name": "Wireless Headphones",
  "slug": "another-headphones",
  "description": "Testing duplicate product name",
  "sku": "WH-1002",
  "price": 1999.99
}

###


